# Deploy (Vercel)

- Build: see `vercel.json` (`ensure_satori_assets.sh` → sync, `validate_theme_tokens.py`, `validate_content.py`, `validate_satori_manifest.py`, Pelican, sitemap)
- Output directory: `output`
- Production SITEURL: `https://promptanatomy.blog` in `publishconf.py` only
- Dev: `pelicanconf.py` uses relative URLs / localhost
- Node build steps: `build:analytics` (esbuild) and conditional Satori via `scripts/ensure_satori_assets.sh` — see `scripts/vercel_build.sh`
